ng>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/18d48508-31bc-40d2-b00b-95399a56a4b3?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-08-11 17:09:39] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-08-11T17:09:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-11T17:09:39+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184295450,"discussion_id":"c8514f77b2e2f9a4f85a9a5ac8dfa0854242a303","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n此 diff 将比较模式从 `COMPARE_MODE_GT`（旧：`self > threshold`）切换到 `COMPARE_MODE_LE`（新：`self <= threshold`），并交换了 Select 参数以保持非 NaN 值的逻辑等价性 — 两者都实现 `self > threshold ? gradOutput : 0`。\n\n**对于 NaN 输入，行为发生了变化：**\n\n这与 `threshold_grad_v2_d_def.cpp` 第16行的算子规范相矛盾，该规范声明：`out = self>threshold ? gradOutput : 0`。根据该规范，NaN `self` 应产生输出 0，而不是 gradOutput。\n\n**受影响的模板：** 仅限 `ThresholdGradV2DDag`（浮点类型：fp16、bf16、fp32）。int32/int8/uint8 类型不受影响，因为它们不能表示 NaN。\n\n**可能的理由：** 如果 Ascend 硬件的 `COMPARE_MODE_GT` 为 NaN 产生不可靠/垃圾掩码值（这可能是 PR 标题提到的\"精度问题\"），那么旧代码的 NaN 行为本身就是未定义的。此更改通过使用 `COMPARE_MODE_LE`（可能正确处理 NaN）确保可预测的输出。然而，语义变更应被记录并与规范对齐。\n\n对 line_start 39, 59, 78 的 Compare 行进行锚定，因为比较模式更改是根本原因。\n\n**建议**：确认 NaN 行为变更是有意的。如果是，更新 `threshold_grad_v2_d_def.cpp` 第16行的算子规范以记录新的 NaN 语义。如果规范中的 `self>threshold ? gradOutput : 0` 必须对 NaN 输入返回 0，则在 Select 之前添加显式的 NaN 检查（类似于 `hardtanh_grad` 使用 `COMPARE_MODE_NE` 排除 NaN 的做法），或将比较/选择逻辑恢复为 GT 模式并调查硬件 GT 比较中的 NaN 精度问题。","created_at":"2026-08-11T17:36:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T14:49:04+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6822d31324adff5452d7be49","login":"ligen75","object_id":"6822d31324adff5452d7be49","name":"ligen75","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ligen75"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":39,"end_new_line":39,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":184436718,"discussion_id":"51a547395b8db9a7153a449aa9ce5117f5c93a73","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-08-12T14:47:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T14:47:04+08:00","user":{"id":"68776ee7fc42115893ad8ad9","login":"wang-xing001","object_id":"68776ee7fc42115893ad8ad9","name":"wang-xing001","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184437023,"discussion_id":"27f10dec823b21df0fba18fff88ea21c06648cde","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-08-12T14:48:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T14:48:00+08:00","user":{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","object_id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184437090,"discussion_id":"ec89b04b6436986af86f1d47d135ea3ff21d1f27","body":"The MR can not be merged, because of CodeReview discussion not resolved\n\nIf you want to solve this problem, [you can click here to do it in the **<font color=red>_FAQs_</font>**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-faq).","created_at":"2026-08-12T14:48:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-12T14:48:14+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?t